==English==

===Etymology===
Attested since about 1790, from {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|centenarius||of one hundred|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|centeni||lang=la|one hundred each}} (from {{term|centum||hundred|lang=la}}) + {{term|-arius}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of, pertaining to, or completing a period of 100 years.

